OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 14 JAN
OL,4,G1930FJo Whiley
OL,5,     GJo handpicks her favourite new
OL,6,     Gmusic from all genres of the
OL,7,     Gmusical spectrum and quality
OL,8,     Gvintage songs too.
OL,9,G2100FThe Folk Show with Mark Radcliffe
OL,10,     GMark revisits the 'skiffle boom'
OL,11,     Gthat inspired countless musicians
OL,12,     Gto discover folk music.
OL,13,G2200FThe Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,14,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,15,     Ggroove, from soulful house to
OL,16,     GRnB, disco to doo-wop and
OL,17,     Geverything else in-between. Join
OL,18,     Gin with addictive guessing game
OL,19,     G'Music Is The Answer'.
